"use strict";(self.webpackChunkdoc_hostmigrationcore=self.webpackChunkdoc_hostmigrationcore||[]).push([[3361],{4782:e=>{e.exports=JSON.parse('{"archive":{"blogPosts":[{"id":"1-1-3","metadata":{"permalink":"/changelog/1-1-3","source":"@site/changelog/2026-11-10-1-1-3/index.md","title":"HostMigrationCore 1.1.3","description":"Added","date":"2026-11-10T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"hasTruncateMarker":false,"authors":[],"frontMatter":{"title":"HostMigrationCore 1.1.3","slug":"1-1-3"},"unlisted":false,"nextItem":{"title":"HostMigrationCore 1.1.1 / 1.1.2","permalink":"/changelog/1-1-1-1-1-2"}},"content":"## Added\\n\\n- The debug overlay displays the player\'s role, migration state, epoch, current host, successor list, snapshots, and lobby.\\n- Move Party To Host sends the connected clients to another host before moving the current host.\\n\\n![Move Party To Host Blueprint node](./MovePartyToHost.png)\\n- Added On Host Connection Lost.\\n\\n![On Host Connection Lost Blueprint event](./HostConnectionLost.png)\\n\\n## Changed\\n\\n- When the plugin finds multiple hosts, it prefers the one with the newest epoch and uses player count as a tiebreaker.\\n- Switching lobbies mid-match is treated as leaving the match.\\n- Steam and EOS automatically rejoin the match lobby if a player loses membership during play.\\n\\n[Original release notes](https://eeldev.com/index.php/host-migration-1-1-3/)"},{"id":"1-1-1-1-1-2","metadata":{"permalink":"/changelog/1-1-1-1-1-2","source":"@site/changelog/2026-11-08-1-1-1-1-1-2/index.md","title":"HostMigrationCore 1.1.1 / 1.1.2","description":"Added","date":"2026-11-08T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"hasTruncateMarker":false,"authors":[],"frontMatter":{"title":"HostMigrationCore 1.1.1 / 1.1.2","slug":"1-1-1-1-1-2"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"HostMigrationCore 1.1.3","permalink":"/changelog/1-1-3"},"nextItem":{"title":"HostMigrationCore 1.1.0","permalink":"/changelog/1-1-0"}},"content":"## Added\\n\\n- [Wait For Game Ready](/docfiles/features/game-ready) lets games such as Lyra defer restoring the snapshot until they call Notify Game Ready. Is Restore Pending lets the game skip setup such as a new warmup, and Game Ready Timeout resumes restoration if the signal never arrives.\\n- Restore Into Game Pawn applies the returning player\'s saved state and position to the pawn spawned by the game. Players who reconnect later also wait for their game-spawned pawn.\\n- Added the [Lyra Sample Project tutorial](/docfiles/tutorials/lyra-match).\\n- Is Host Migration Network Failure lets a session plugin\'s error handler identify migration-related failures and keep the session open.\\n\\n## Fixed\\n\\n- The successor carries over the previous host\'s map URL options, including game mode parameters such as `?Experience=X?NumBots=0`.\\n- Clients that lose lobby membership during migration no longer start a second host. Steam and EOS clients try to rejoin the lobby, then fall back to connecting directly to the successor\'s platform address.\\n\\n[Original release notes](https://eeldev.com/index.php/host-migration-1-1-1/)"},{"id":"1-1-0","metadata":{"permalink":"/changelog/1-1-0","source":"@site/changelog/2026-10-31-1-1-0/index.md","title":"HostMigrationCore 1.1.0","description":"Added","date":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"hasTruncateMarker":false,"authors":[],"frontMatter":{"title":"HostMigrationCore 1.1.0","slug":"1-1-0"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"HostMigrationCore 1.1.1 / 1.1.2","permalink":"/changelog/1-1-1-1-1-2"},"nextItem":{"title":"HostMigrationCore 1.0.3","permalink":"/changelog/1-0-3"}},"content":"## Added\\n\\n- Added the [EOS Adapter](/docfiles/features/eos) in the `HostMigrationCoreEOS` module. It discovers the lobby, tracks who is still in the match, and advertises the new host through member attributes. It keeps lobby ownership with the current host so Join Session still works after a handoff. It supports OnlineSubsystemEOS, EOSCore 1.9.8.9 or later, and direct EOS SDK integrations.\\n- An empty Adapter Class now selects the EOS Adapter automatically when `DefaultPlatformService` is `EOS` or `EOSCore`.\\n\\n## Changed\\n\\n- Renamed Steam Lobby to Steam Adapter in Project Settings. Existing configurations still work.\\n\\n## Fixed\\n\\n- During non-seamless `ServerTravel`, clients that miss the map change can reconnect if the host remains in the session. This handles cases such as EOS closing the host\'s P2P socket while the map loads.\\n- The warning about using the Null adapter with a Steam or EOS net driver now identifies the corresponding adapter.\\n- Get Steam Lobby and Get EOS Lobby are now callable in Blueprint. Their C++ versions are static and take a world context, like the corresponding setters.\\n\\n[Original release notes](https://eeldev.com/index.php/host-migration-1-1-0/)"},{"id":"1-0-3","metadata":{"permalink":"/changelog/1-0-3","source":"@site/changelog/2026-10-24-1-0-3/index.md","title":"HostMigrationCore 1.0.3","description":"Added","date":"2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"hasTruncateMarker":false,"authors":[],"frontMatter":{"title":"HostMigrationCore 1.0.3","slug":"1-0-3"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"HostMigrationCore 1.1.0","permalink":"/changelog/1-1-0"},"nextItem":{"title":"HostMigrationCore 1.0.2","permalink":"/changelog/1-0-2"}},"content":"## Added\\n\\n- Added the Connect Attempt Timeout setting.\\n\\n## Fixed\\n\\n- Resolved a crash when the host election picked a client that was still trying to rejoin the host.\\n- Fixed clients disconnecting a few seconds after they reached the new host.\\n- Restored the previous host\'s state and pawn on reconnection during the grace period.\\n- Corrected rejoin handling for host addresses that contain a colon.\\n\\n[Original release notes](https://eeldev.com/index.php/host-migration-1-0-3/)"},{"id":"1-0-2","metadata":{"permalink":"/changelog/1-0-2","source":"@site/changelog/2026-10-17-1-0-2/index.md","title":"HostMigrationCore 1.0.2","description":"General","date":"2026-10-17T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"hasTruncateMarker":false,"authors":[],"frontMatter":{"title":"HostMigrationCore 1.0.2","slug":"1-0-2"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"HostMigrationCore 1.0.3","permalink":"/changelog/1-0-3"}},"content":"## General\\n\\n- Expanded debug logging across the plugin to make it easier to trace function calls.\\n- Grouped `HostMigrationSubsystem` variables into structs as part of a cleanup.\\n\\n[Original release notes](https://eeldev.com/index.php/host-migration-core-1-0-2/)"}]}}')}}]);